CHAPTER.VERS:
Don't be

          {+}
         afraid, neither be scared: Have I not declared to you of old, and shown it? And you

          {+}
         are my witnesses. Is there a God besides me? Yes, there is no Rock; I don't know any.

Sing, O you

          {+}
         heavens, for Yahweh has done it; shout, you

          {+}
         lower parts of the earth; break forth into singing, you

          {+}
         mountains, O forest, and every tree in it: for Yahweh has redeemed Jacob, and will glorify himself in Israel.
